送"},"190":{"id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/api/judge-4","page_id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/api/judge","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/Hydro/api/judge#测试数据下载","content":"测试数据下载"},"191":{"id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/api/judge-5","page_id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/api/judge","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/Hydro/api/judge#评测结果上报","content":"评测结果上报"},"192":{"id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/api/judge-6","page_id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/api/judge","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/Hydro/api/judge","content":"当前版本 v1 。"},"193":{"id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/api/judge-7","page_id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/api/judge","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/Hydro/api/judge#评测端交互流程","content":"GET /judge/files (检查登陆状态是否有效，若无效则跳转登录逻辑，通常每六小时执行一次)"},"194":{"id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/api/judge-8","page_id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/api/judge","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/Hydro/api/judge#评测端交互流程","content":"WEBSOCKET /judge/conn （主交互通道）"},"195":{"id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/api/judge-9","page_id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/api/judge","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/Hydro/api/judge#评测端交互流程","content":"若登录失效，则进行登录操作。"},"196":{"id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/api/judge-10","page_id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/api/judge","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/Hydro/api/judge#websocket-连接建立流程","content":"连接建立后，评测端向 Web 汇报当前节点状态（可选）注：下方信息仅作数据格式展示用，不保证真实有效。"},"197":{"id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/api/judge-11","page_id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/api/judge","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/Hydro/api/judge#websocket-连接建立流程","content":"建立连接后每隔 30s，评测端发送 {\"key\":\"ping\"}。"},"198":{"id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/api/judge-12","page_id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/api/judge","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/Hydro/api/judge#语言配置下发","content":"在连接建立后，Web 端会向 Judge 分发服务端的语言设置。如果客户端需要进行特殊设置，可忽略此条消息。"},"199":{"id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/api/judge-13","page_id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/api/judge","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/Hydro/api/judge#评测任务推送","content":"Web 端会通过 WebSocket 向评测端推送评测任务。"},"200":{"id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/api/judge-14","page_id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/api/judge","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/Hydro/api/judge#评测任务推送","content":"注1：如果比赛 ID 为 000000000000000000000000 则表示此提交为自测提交，自测提交使用 input 字段值作为程序输入。注2：source 字段为缓存 ID，同 source 字段的提交使用相同的缓存目录。注3：source 字段包含且仅包含一个字符 /，建议使用 domainId/pid。注4：测试数据的 etag 用来识别本地缓存的文件是否与云端一致，可使用 hash 或是修改时间的时间戳。"},"201":{"id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/api/judge-15","page_id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/api/judge","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/Hydro/api/judge#测试数据下载","content":"若推送的评测任务中使用了的测试数据缺失，Judge 端会向 Web 请求缺失或是修改的文件。"},"202":{"id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/api/judge-16","page_id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/api/judge","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/Hydro/api/judge#测试数据下载","content":"服务端返回如下："},"203":{"id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/api/judge-17","page_id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/api/judge","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/Hydro/api/judge#评测结果上报","content":"除 key, domainId, rid 三个字段外，其他字段均为可选。关于 STATUS_CODE 含义请查看 hydro-dev/Hydro/packages/utils/lib/status 。当 key 为 end 时表示评测任务已经完成，结果确定，Web 端可进行 AC 数计量，登记成绩表等操作。"},"204":{"id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/FAQ/debug","page_id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/FAQ/debug","type":"page","content":"排障指南","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Hydro","常见问题"],"tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/Hydro/FAQ/debug"},"205":{"id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/FAQ/debug-0","page_id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/FAQ/debug","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/Hydro/FAQ/debug#hydrooj","content":"hydrooj"},"206":{"id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/FAQ/debug-1","page_id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/FAQ/debug","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/Hydro/FAQ/debug#前端异常","content":"前端异常"},"207":{"id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/FAQ/debug-2","page_id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/FAQ/debug","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/Hydro/FAQ/debug","content":"进入服务器控制台，使用 pm2 ls 查看当前运行的进程列表。在正常情况下，应当有四个进程在运行，分别是 hydrooj、hydro-sandbox、mongodb 和 caddy。若进程缺失，请 pm2 stop all 后 pm2 del all 再重新运行安装脚本。"},"208":{"id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/FAQ/debug-3","page_id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/FAQ/debug","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/Hydro/FAQ/debug","content":"检查各个进程是否已经启动（ status 为 online 且 uptime 至少一分钟）"},"209":{"id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/FAQ/debug-4","page_id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/FAQ/debug","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/Hydro/FAQ/debug","content":"如果 caddy 无法启动，通常是端口被占用或 ~/.hydro/Caddyfile 配置错误，可尝试 cd ~/.hydro && caddy run 查看详情。如果 hydro-sandbox 无法启动，通常是权限不足 / 内核版本过低，使用 pm2 logs hydro-sandbox --lines 100 查看详情。如果 hydrooj 无法启动 / 启动后没有正常运行，请看下方章节。"},"210":{"id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/FAQ/debug-5","page_id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/FAQ/debug","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/Hydro/FAQ/debug#hydrooj","content":"pm2 stop hydrooj 关闭后直接运行 hydrooj 命令可让 Hydro 在前台运行，便于查看日志。"},"211":{"id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/FAQ/debug-6","page_id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/FAQ/debug","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/Hydro/FAQ/debug#hydrooj","content":"尝试更新到最新版本，检查是否能正常使用。"},"212":{"id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/FAQ/debug-7","page_id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/FAQ/debug","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/Hydro/FAQ/debug#hydrooj","content":"cp ~/.hydro/addon.json ~/.hydro/addon.json.bak 备份插件列表。"},"213":{"id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/FAQ/debug-8","page_id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/FAQ/debug","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/Hydro/FAQ/debug#hydrooj","content":"hydrooj addon list 查看插件列表，并使用 hydrooj addon remove 名称 禁用所有非官方提供的插件（即不含 @hydrooj/ 前缀的插件）"},"214":{"id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/FAQ/debug-9","page_id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/FAQ/debug","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/Hydro/FAQ/debug#hydrooj","content":"重启检查是否正常运行。"},"215":{"id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/FAQ/debug-10","page_id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/FAQ/debug","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/Hydro/FAQ/debug#hydrooj","content":"如果能够运行，则为第三方插件导致，可按顺序尝试加载刚刚禁用的插件，检查是否出现异常，联系对应插件提供方解决。"},"216":{"id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/FAQ/debug-11","page_id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/FAQ/debug","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/Hydro/FAQ/debug#hydrooj","content":"如果不能正常运行，请向开发组提供自 Hydro 开始启动至触发故障的完整日志以便于诊断问题。"},"217":{"id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/FAQ/debug-12","page_id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/FAQ/debug","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/Hydro/FAQ/debug#前端异常","content":"指前端页面无法加载（持续转圈或是左下角黄色 / 红色错误提示）"},"218":{"id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/FAQ/debug-13","page_id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/FAQ/debug","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/Hydro/FAQ/debug#前端异常","content":"使用 Ctrl+Shift+Delete 清除浏览器缓存再试。"},"219":{"id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/FAQ/debug-14","page_id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/FAQ/debug","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/Hydro/FAQ/debug#前端异常","content":"更新 chrome 浏览器至最新版尝试。"},"220":{"id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/FAQ/debug-15","page_id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/FAQ/debug","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/Hydro/FAQ/debug#前端异常","content":"同上，尝试禁用第三方插件。"},"221":{"id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/FAQ/debug-16","page_id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/FAQ/debug","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/Hydro/FAQ/debug#前端异常","content":"如果问题仍未解决，打开 F12 开发者控制台，转到 Console (控制台) 标签页，查看是否有报错信息。"},"222":{"id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/FAQ/debug-17","page_id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/FAQ/debug","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/Hydro/FAQ/debug#前端异常","content":"打开 Network (网络) 标签页，查看是否有请求失败的情况。"},"223":{"id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/FAQ/debug-18","page_id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/FAQ/debug","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/Hydro/FAQ/debug#前端异常","content":"加群反馈，附上上述截图。"},"224":{"id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/FAQ","page_id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/FAQ","type":"page","content":"常见问题集合","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Hydro","常见问题"],"tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/Hydro/FAQ"},"225":{"id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/FAQ-0","page_id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/FAQ","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/Hydro/FAQ#好消息本页和各大浏览器均达成了合作使用-ctrl-f-即可快速搜索关键词","content":"好消息！本页和各大浏览器均达成了合作，使用 Ctrl-F 即可快速搜索关键词！"},"226":{"id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/FAQ-1","page_id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/FAQ","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/Hydro/FAQ#更多教程请点击常用教程查看","content":"更多教程请点击常用教程查看。"},"227":{"id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/FAQ-2","page_id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/FAQ","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/Hydro/FAQ#用户qq群-1085853538","content":"用户QQ群 1085853538"},"228":{"id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/FAQ-3","page_id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/FAQ","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/Hydro/FAQ#如何快速上手了解系统功能","content":"如何快速上手了解系统功能？"},"229":{"id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/FAQ-4","page_id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/FAQ","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/Hydro/FAQ#什么是-oj","content":"什么是 OJ？"},"2