出现中文题面乱码；\n在新版本 fps-importer 中，管理员可以修改导入文件大小限制，但请注意，我们仍不建议您导入过大的题目包。\n若您的文件超过大小限制，可考虑先在本地使用 Easy-Fps-Viewer 等工具进行拆分。"},"686":{"id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/geoip","page_id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/geoip","type":"page","content":"GeoIP","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Hydro","插件"],"tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/geoip"},"687":{"id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/geoip-0","page_id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/geoip","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/geoip","content":"插件需要 MaxMind 的 Geolite2-City.mmdb 支持，在安装插件后需要将mmdb拷贝至插件同一目录下方可启用，如果你不知道这是什么，请勿安装。"},"688":{"id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge","page_id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge","type":"page","content":"hydrojudge","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Hydro","插件"],"tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge"},"689":{"id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge-0","page_id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge#准备","content":"准备"},"690":{"id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge-1","page_id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge#安装","content":"安装"},"691":{"id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge-2","page_id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge#作为附加组件","content":"作为附加组件"},"692":{"id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge-3","page_id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge#作为独立进程","content":"作为独立进程"},"693":{"id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge-4","page_id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge#更新","content":"更新"},"694":{"id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge-5","page_id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge#关闭","content":"关闭"},"695":{"id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge-6","page_id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge","ty