:"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge#作为附加组件","content":"由于用附加组件安装的评测机与 Hydro 必须在同一台服务器上，每一个 Hydro 实例最多只能有一台评测机由附加组件安装。"},"715":{"id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge-26","page_id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge#作为附加组件","content":"在安装 Hydro 的机器上运行下面的指令安装 @hydrooj/hydrojudge："},"716":{"id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge-27","page_id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge#作为附加组件","content":"重启 Hydro 后 hydrojudge 即可正常运行。"},"717":{"id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge-28","page_id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge#作为独立进程","content":"该方法可以帮助您在任意服务器上部署评测机。"},"718":{"id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge-29","page_id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge#作为独立进程","content":"type: warn"},"719":{"id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge-30","page_id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge#作为独立进程","content":"我们推荐所有独立评测机使用相同配置机器并关闭内置评测机, 以保证评测结果的稳定性。系统设置中的评测机相关选项仅控制内置评测机, 独立评测机需要在 judge.yaml 中进行设置。"},"720":{"id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge-31","page_id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge#作为独立进程","content":"首先需要创建一个有 PRIV_JUDGE 权限的账户，具体方法参照 此处。（在部署 Hydro 的服务器上运行）"},"721":{"id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge-32","page_id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge#作为独立进程","content":"然后在运行评测机的服务器上安装 HydroJudge ："},"722":{"id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge-33","page_id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge#作为独立进程","content":"创建目录 ~/.config/hydro，在该目录下创建文件 judge.yaml，配置文件格式如下："},"723":{"id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge-34","page_id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge#作为独立进程","content":"设置完之后，使用下面的指令即可开始运行（可以使用 pm2 管理）："},"724":{"id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge-35","page_id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge#更新","content":"HydroJudge 会发布不定期更新。您可以使用 yarn global upgrade-interactive --latest 来检测并进行更新。"},"725":{"id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge-36","page_id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge#关闭","content":"作为附加组件: 在 系统设置>配置管理 中有一栏 Disable builtin judge，将它勾上，然后重启 Hydro。"},"726":{"id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge-37","page_id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge#关闭","content":"作为独立进程: 根据开启的方法关闭。"},"727":{"id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge-38","page_id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge#卸载","content":"关闭后运行下面指令即可。"},"728":{"id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge-39","page_id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge#作为附加组件-1","content":"在 系统设置>hydrojudge 修改对应的参数，然后重启 Hydro 和 hydrojudge 即可。"},"729":{"id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge-40","page_id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge#作为独立进程-1","content":"如果有需要修改单题测试点数量上限等设置，可以在 ~/.config/hydro/judge.yaml 的末尾添加下列内容："},"730":{"id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge-41","page_id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge#作为独立进程-1","content":"在 此处 的设置均可添加到此处。"},"731":{"id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge-42","page_id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge#修改编译选项添加新语言支持","content":"在 控制面板>系统设置 中修改 hydrooj.langs 配置项(对所有连接到该服务器的评测机生效)或在 ~/.config/hydro/langs.yaml 中配置(对单个独立评测机生效, 不推荐)。"},"732":{"id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge-43","page_id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge#修改编译选项添加新语言支持","content":"文件格式参照 此处 。"},"733":{"id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge-44","page_id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge#修改编译选项添加新语言支持","content":"如果您添加了新的语言，您还需要前往 控制面板>系统设置 中修改 Language Highlight ID 与 Monaco language modes。分别表示选择对应的语言后的高亮设置（基于 PrismJS）和 Monaco 编辑器语法规则设置。"},"734":{"id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge-45","page_id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge#修改编译选项添加新语言支持","content":"修改完后请重启 Hydro 和 hydrojudge 。"},"735":{"id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge-46","page_id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge#修改编译选项添加新语言支持","content":"在 编译器和语言 章节可查看更多信息。"},"736":{"id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge-47","page_id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge#调试沙箱环境","content":"如果需要调试沙箱内的编译或者运行错误，可以使用 hydrojudge terminal 来打开评测交互终端。该终端运行于与评测环境相同的独立沙箱内。"},"737":{"id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge-48","page_id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge#清除数据缓存","content":"若需要清除评测数据缓存，可以使用 hydrojudge cache prune 清除 30 天之内未使用的测试数据，需指定天数可添加参数 --duration=x 清除 x 天数据。"},"738":{"id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge-49","page_id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge#清除数据缓存","content":"若需清除所有缓存数据，可以使用 hydrojudge cache clean 命令。"},"739":{"id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge-50","page_id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge#测试数据格式","content":"参照 测试数据格式 配置。"},"740":{"id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge-51","page_id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge#调整沙箱空间大小","content":"type: warn"},"741":{"id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge-52","page_id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge#调整沙箱空间大小","content":"如果不调整沙箱的空间大小，当您的评测使用文件 IO 且输入输出文件较大时可能会引发错误。"},"742":{"id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge-53","page_id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge#调整沙箱空间大小","content":"对于 2022/8/12 前安装的用户："},"743":{"id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge-54","page_id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge#调整沙箱空间大小","content":"在服务器上运行下面的代码找到 hydro-sandbox 的运行目录："},"744":{"id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge-55","page_id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge#调整沙箱空间大小","content":"参照 沙箱文件系统挂载文档 中的自定义挂载的配置，保存配置内容到运行目录并命名为 mount.yaml。\n修改配置文件中 work dir 和 tmp dir 所对应 size 和 nr_inodes 的挂载参数至您想要的大小，保存后重启 hydro-sandbox 即可完成更改。"},"745":{"id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge-56","page_id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge#调整沙箱空间大小","content":"对于 2022/8/12 后安装的用户："},"746":{"id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge-57","page_id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge#调整沙箱空间大小","content":"编辑 /root/.hydro/mount.yaml，修改 size 即可。"},"747":{"id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge-58","page_id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge#开大程序运行栈空间","content":"2022/8/12 后安装的实例默认已开启无限栈空间，无需手动操作"},"748":{"id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge-59","page_id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge#开大程序运行栈空间","content":"在很多时候系统默认为程序提供的栈空间并不能满足我们的需求，此时我们需要手动为用户程序提供更大的栈空间。"},"749":{"id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge-60","page_id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge#开大程序运行栈空间","content":"修改 pm2 中 hydro-sandbox 的启动参数为 ulimit -s unlimited && /usr/bin/hydro-sandbox ："},"750":{"id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge-61","page_id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge#提高测评精度","content":"禁用 CPU 频率缩放与 Intel 睿频加速技术，防止 CPU 频率波动。"},"751":{"id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge-62","page_id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge#提高测评精度","content":"禁用内存地址空间随机化，以使得存在内存寻址错误的代码能够得到更多可重复的结果，可以通过在 /etc/sysctl.conf 中添加下面这行并运行 sudo sysctl -p 应用："},"752":{"id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge-63","page_id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge#提高测评精度","content":"启用沙箱的 CPU 绑定功能，例如在 8 核系统上，限制评测任务仅使用 CPU 2,4,6 时可以参照以下配置："},"753":{"id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge-64","page_id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge#提高测评精度","content":"这时，最大同时运行任务数限制为 , 分割的核心数量（在这个例子里为 3），并且同时运行的每个评测任务会分别分配到该项配置中的一个核心。启用该配置时， parallelism 建议设置与沙箱任务能够使用的核心数量相同。此项配置需要根据评测机具体的 CPU 配置 (例如是否开启超线程, 使用 NUMA 等情况) 调整。同时，此项配置需要沙箱版本升级至 v1.11.2 或以上。"},"754":{"id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge-65","page_id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge#提高测评精度","content":"同时，如果为了避免其他任务使用这些核心，可以在内核启动参数中使用 isolcpus 配置。例如在 8 核系统上，禁止其他任务使用 CPU 2-7 时可以加入 isolcpus=2-7 内核启动参数。具体可以参照 内存计量不准确 章节内容修改内核启动参数。"},"755":{"id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge-66","page_id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge#内存计量不准确","content":"在控制面板上出现内容为 You are using cgroup v2 without kernel 5.19+. This could result in inaccurate memory usage measurements. 警告时，意味着当前系统的内存消耗计量存在误差。"},"756":{"id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge-67","page_id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge#内存计量不准确","content":"部分 Linux 设备默认使用 cgroup2，而在 5.19 版本前的内核的 cgroup2 中移除了精确计量内存消耗的接口。\n若要获得更精确的内存计量，推荐启用 cgroup v1 (您可以通过检查 /sys/fs/cgroup/memory/memory.memsw.usage_in_bytes 是否存在来验证是否当前系统是否启用了 cgroup v1 )："},"757":{"id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge-68","page_id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge#内存计量不准确","content":"以 Ubuntu 的默认引导器 GRUB 2 为例，编辑 /etc/default/grub：\n在其中"},"758":{"id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge-69","page_id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge#内存计量不准确","content":"后，加入 `cgroup_enable=memory swapaccount=1 systemd.unified_cgroup_hierarchy=0，变为："},"759":{"id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge-70","page_id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge#内存计量不准确","content":"运行以下命令更新 GRUB 2 的配置，然后重新启动。"},"760":{"id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge-71","page_id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge#内存控制器未开启","content":"在控制面板上出现内容为 The memory cgroup controller is not enabled. This could result in inaccurate memory usage measurements. 警告时，意味着当前系统并没有开启内存 cgroup 控制器。"},"761":{"id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge-72","page_id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge#内存控制器未开启","content":"部分 Linux (如 Raspbian) 并不会默认开启内存 cgroup 控制器，启用内存控制器可以获得更精确的内存限制和计量。"},"762":{"id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge-73","page_id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge#内存控制器未开启","content":"以 Raspbian 为例，编辑 /boot/firmware/cmdline.txt (如果不存在则 /boot/cmdline.txt)：\n在末尾添加（注意空格）"},"763":{"id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge-74","page_id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge#内存控制器未开启","content":"重启之后检查 /proc/cgroups 确认内存控制器 memory 已开启。"},"764":{"id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge-75","page_id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge#swap-限制未生效","content":"若 Hydro 提示以下警告，表示 go-judge 未报告已启用 swap 限制。内存限制可能无法限制交换空间使用，内存计量也可能不准确："},"765":{"id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge-76","page_id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge#swap-限制未生效","content":"go-judge swap limits are unavailable. Memory limits may not restrict swap use, and memory usage measurements may be inaccurate."},"766":{"id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge-77","page_id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge#swap-限制未生效","content":"请确认系统提供并启用了 swap accounting 和内存 cgroup 限制。使用 rlimit/rusage 回退模式时无法限制交换空间。可参照内存计量不准确章节，为内核启动参数添加 swapaccount=1。"},"767":{"id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge-78","page_id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge#seccomp-未启用","content":"若 Hydro 提示以下警告，表示 go-judge 未启用 seccomp，沙箱隔离能力会降低："},"768":{"id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge-79","page_id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge#seccomp-未启用","content":"Seccomp is not enabled in go-judge. This reduces sandbox isolation."},"769":{"id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge-80","page_id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge#seccomp-未启用","content":"请检查 go-judge 的运行环境和启动配置，确保 seccomp 可用并已启用，然后重启 go-judge。"},"770":{"id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge-81","page_id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge#seccomp-未启用","content":"较旧版本的 go-judge 可能不支持 seccomp。若当前版本不支持，请升级到最新版，再启用 seccomp 并重启服务。"},"771":{"id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge-82","page_id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins/hydrojudge#seccomp-未启用","content":"若宿主机内核存在可利用的提权漏洞，缺少 seccomp 限制可能进一步增加沙箱内程序利用该漏洞影响宿主机的风险。请确保 go-judge 已启用 seccomp，并及时更新宿主机内核。"},"772":{"id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins","page_id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins","type":"page","content":"插件","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Hydro","插件"],"tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins"},"773":{"id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins-0","page_id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins#附加组件列表","content":"附加组件列表"},"774":{"id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins-1","page_id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins#安装","content":"安装"},"775":{"id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins-2","page_id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins#查看已注册的插件列表","content":"查看已注册的插件列表"},"776":{"id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins-3","page_id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins#更新","content":"更新"},"777":{"id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins-4","page_id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins#卸载","content":"卸载"},"778":{"id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins-5","page_id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins","content":"Hydro 支持使用插件扩展自身所支持的功能。"},"779":{"id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins-6","page_id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins","content":"type: warn"},"780":{"id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins-7","page_id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins","content":"插件对站点的所有内容具有完全的访问权限，请不要启用来历不明的插件。"},"781":{"id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins-8","page_id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/Hydro/plugins#附加组件列表","content":"使用安装脚本安装时会自动安装下方加粗的插件。\n部分插件（斜体标注）需配合第三方软件使用，如仅安装不配置/不安装第三方软件会导致系统无法正常运行，详情请前往左侧插件详情查看。"},"782":{"id":"/z