r 请求。"},"923":{"id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/system/cdn-5","page_id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/system/cdn","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/Hydro/system/cdn#全站-cdn","content":"如果您预算充足，可以使用全站 CDN。"},"924":{"id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/system/cdn-6","page_id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/system/cdn","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/Hydro/system/cdn#全站-cdn","content":"type: warn"},"925":{"id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/system/cdn-7","page_id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/system/cdn","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/Hydro/system/cdn#全站-cdn","content":"全站 CDN 配置较为繁琐，如您没有相关使用经验请仅建立并配置资源 CDN ，配置资源 CDN 在大部分情况下即可大幅度改善访问质量。\n因各服务商全站 CDN 配置方法不同，配置过程不同，需要配置的内容较多，以下仅为参考配置，如果有任何问题建议先查阅云服务商文档及咨询云服务商工程师。"},"926":{"id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/system/cdn-8","page_id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/system/cdn","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/Hydro/system/cdn#全站-cdn","content":"type: warn"},"927":{"id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/system/cdn-9","page_id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/system/cdn","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/Hydro/system/cdn#全站-cdn","content":"配置全站 CDN 时需要启用 CDN 的 WebSocket 支持（不同服务商开启方式可能不同，且可能额外收费），否则会导致评测状态无法自动更新/IDE无法使用等等问题。请确认仅缓存了资源文件！否则可能导致用户登录状态混乱。"},"928":{"id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/system/cdn-10","page_id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/system/cdn","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/Hydro/system/cdn#全站-cdn","content":"缓存设置可以参考以下设置："},"929":{"id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/system/cdn-11","page_id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/system/cdn","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/Hydro/system/cdn#全站-cdn","content":"类型"},"930":{"id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/system/cdn-12","page_id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/system/cdn","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/Hydro/system/cdn#全站-cdn","content":"内容"},"931":{"id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/system/cdn-13","page_id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/system/cdn","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/Hydro/system/cdn#全站-cdn","content":"缓存行为"},"932":{"id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/system/cdn-14","page_id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/system/cdn","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/Hydro/system/cdn#全站-cdn","content":"全部文件"},"933":{"id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/system/cdn-15","page_id":"/zh/docs/Hydro/system/cd