estant machines);"},"157":{"id":"/en/docs/Tools-14","page_id":"/en/docs/Tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/Tools#day--1-preparation","content":"The server runs Linux with a relatively new kernel. Older kernel versions are known to potentially freeze under high load details;"},"158":{"id":"/en/docs/Tools-15","page_id":"/en/docs/Tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/Tools#day--1-preparation","content":"About the CAICPC image:"},"159":{"id":"/en/docs/Tools-16","page_id":"/en/docs/Tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/Tools#day--1-preparation","content":"This image is modified from the standard ICPC image."},"160":{"id":"/en/docs/Tools-17","page_id":"/en/docs/Tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/Tools#day--1-preparation","content":"Added status reporting for unified server status monitoring;"},"161":{"id":"/en/docs/Tools-18","page_id":"/en/docs/Tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/Tools#day--1-preparation","content":"Supports calling VLC to capture screen and camera streams for the live module;"},"162":{"id":"/en/docs/Tools-19","page_id":"/en/docs/Tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/Tools#day--1-preparation","content":"Supports batch dispatch of management commands (one-click lock screen / unlock / reboot / show seat number, etc.);"},"163":{"id":"/en/docs/Tools-20","page_id":"/en/docs/Tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/Tools#day-0-preparation","content":"Install Hydro using the installation script."},"164":{"id":"/en/docs/Tools-21","page_id":"/en/docs/Tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/Tools#day-0-preparation","content":"Import required contest users."},"165":{"id":"/en/docs/Tools-22","page_id":"/en/docs/Tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/Tools#day-0-preparation","content":"Install the @hydrooj/onsite-toolkit plugin."},"166":{"id":"/en/docs/Tools-23","page_id":"/en/docs/Tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/Tools#day-0-preparation","content":"Install standalone modu