"tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/Hydro/FAQ#execve-no-such-file-or-directory","content":"Script installation installs only a small subset of compilers by default. Please refer to the Compiler section to install/configure other compilers."},"317":{"id":"/en/docs/Hydro/FAQ-82","page_id":"/en/docs/Hydro/FAQ","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/Hydro/FAQ#how-to-customize-user-badges","content":"Enter MongoDB and execute the following (replace placeholders in angle brackets accordingly):"},"318":{"id":"/en/docs/Hydro/FAQ-83","page_id":"/en/docs/Hydro/FAQ","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/Hydro/FAQ#why-cant-i-batch-download-multiple-files","content":"Please use a modern browser and try enabling HTTPS for your site.\nOtherwise, download files one by one (Ctrl+click filename)."},"319":{"id":"/en/docs/Hydro/FAQ-84","page_id":"/en/docs/Hydro/FAQ","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/Hydro/FAQ#why-is-there-no-language-option-on-my-submission-page","content":"Problem -> Judge Settings -> Allowed languagesDomain Settings -> Edit Domain Profile -> Allowed languagesIn both places, fill language IDs separated by English commas. If unsure, leave empty."},"320":{"id":"/en/docs/Hydro/FAQ-85","page_id":"/en/docs/Hydro/FAQ","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/Hydro/FAQ#the-yarn-global-commands-have-been-remove-in-2x---consider-using-yarn-dlx-or-a-third-party-plugin-instead","content":"If you cannot understand this issue, just use the installation script and do not mess with development mode."},"321":{"id":"/en/docs/Hydro/FAQ-86","page_id":"/en/docs/Hydro/FAQ","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/Hydro/FAQ#im-in-a-computer-lab-environment-many-users-share-one-ip-and-trigger-rate-limits-how-to-solve","content":"Option 1: Set up a proxy server in the intranet and forward intranet IPs to the server. (Recommended)Option 2: Use commands like hydrooj cli system set limit.user_login 999 to set new rate limits (the error page shows which limit was triggered)Option 3: S