o/user/domain#overview","content":"The Domain feature functions similarly to \"Teams\" or \"Groups,\" allowing multiple isolated environments (e.g., different classes, clubs, or organizations) within a single Hydro instance."},"1150":{"id":"/en/docs/Hydro/user/domain-9","page_id":"/en/docs/Hydro/user/domain","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/Hydro/user/domain#overview","content":"Users with the PRIV_CREATE_DOMAIN permission (granted to admins by default) can create new domains. Data is fully isolated between domains, though user account credentials are shared across the entire instance."},"1151":{"id":"/en/docs/Hydro/user/domain-10","page_id":"/en/docs/Hydro/user/domain","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/Hydro/user/domain#creating-a-domain","content":"Log in and navigate to the \"My\" tab."},"1152":{"id":"/en/docs/Hydro/user/domain-11","page_id":"/en/docs/Hydro/user/domain","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/Hydro/user/domain#creating-a-domain","content":"Find \"My Domains\" and click \"Create Domain\"."},"1153":{"id":"/en/docs/Hydro/user/domain-12","page_id":"/en/docs/Hydro/user/domain","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/Hydro/user/domain#creating-a-domain","content":"Fill in the following details:"},"1154":{"id":"/en/docs/Hydro/user/domain-13","page_id":"/en/docs/Hydro/user/domain","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/Hydro/user/domain#creating-a-domain","content":"ID: A unique identifier used in the domain's URL. Note: This cannot be changed after creation."},"1155":{"id":"/en/docs/Hydro/user/domain-14","page_id":"/en/docs/Hydro/user/domain","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/Hydro/user/domain#creating-a-domain","content":"Name: The display name of the domain."},"1156":{"id":"/en/docs/Hydro/user/domain-15","page_id":"/en/docs/Hydro/user/domain","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/Hydro/user/domain#creating-a-domain","content":"Announcement: Content shown on the domain's homepage."},"1157":{"id":"/en/docs/Hydro/user/domain-16","pa